</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, I was deaf; I could not hear</l><l>The thrilling music of Thy voice;</l><l>But now I hear Thee and rejoice,</l><l>And all Thine uttered words are dear!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, I was dumb; I could not speak</l><l>The grace and glory of Thy name;</l><l>But now, as touched with living flame,</l><l>My lips Thine eager praises wake.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord, I was dead; I could not stir</l><l>My lifeless soul to come to Thee;</l><l>But now, since Thou hast quickened me,</l><l>I rise from sin’s dark sepulcher.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>For Thou hast made the blind to see,</l><l>The deaf to hear, the dumb to speak,</l><l>The dead to live; and, lo, I break</l><l>The chains of my captivity.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
